    <string name="help_note"><![CDATA[
<big><b>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</b></big><br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">Q: How do I register as a Guru?</font></b><br/>
A: Go to the "Guru Profile" section, list your skills (e.g., Science, Carpentry), and select your available weekend hours.<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">Q: How do I change the language to Kannada?</font></b><br/>
A: You can toggle between English and Kannada in the App Settings menu. The UI is designed to support both seamlessly.<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">Q: Where do the classes take place?</font></b><br/>
A: Classes are typically held at the local Samudaya Bhavana or designated community centers listed in the "Class Calendar."<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">Q: What is the "Wall of Fame"?</font></b><br/>
A: This is where students post "Thank You" notes to appreciate their Gurus. The top-rated mentors are highlighted here to celebrate their contribution to the community.<br/><br/><br/>

_______________________________________<br/><br/>

<big><b>Contact Us</b></big><br/><br/>
If you encounter any technical issues or wish to report a profile:<br/><br/>
• <b>Email:</b> support@nimmaguru.org<br/>
• <b>In-App:</b> Tap on the "Report an Issue" button within the menu.
]]></string>
    <string name="privacy_note"><![CDATA[
<big><b>Privacy Policy</b></big><br/><br/>
<b>Effective Date: May 2026</b><br/><br/>

At <b>Nimma-Guru</b>, we value the privacy of our community members. This policy explains how we handle your data.<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">Data We Collect</font></b><br/>
• <b>For Gurus:</b> Name, skills (e.g., Math, Carpentry), availability, and location (Village/Street).<br/>
• <b>For Students:</b> Name and location to help find local mentors.<br/>
• <b>Content:</b> "Thank You" notes and appreciation messages posted on the "Wall of Fame."<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">How We Use Your Data</font></b><br/>
• To facilitate the connection between mentors and students.<br/>
• To display the Class Calendar for local community centers (Samudaya Bhavana).<br/>
• To improve the GenAI features of the app for better search results.<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">Data Sharing</font></b><br/>
• We <b>do not</b> sell your data.<br/>
• Your profile (Skills and Availability) is visible to other users within your locality to enable the mentorship process.<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">Security</font></b><br/>
We use <b>Firebase Firestore</b> to store data securely. While we strive to protect your information, no digital storage is 100% secure.
]]></string>
    <string name="terms_note"><![CDATA[
<big><b>Terms and Conditions</b></big><br/><br/>
<b>Last Updated: May 2026</b><br/><br/>

By using the Nimma-Guru app, you agree to the following:<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">User Roles</font></b><br/>
• <b>Gurus:</b> Agree to provide voluntary, non-commercial tutoring. You are responsible for the accuracy of your listed skills.<br/>
• <b>Students:</b> Agree to use the platform for educational purposes and to interact with Gurus respectfully.<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">Code of Conduct</font></b><br/>
• <b>Non-Commercial Nature:</b> This app is a platform for "Gyaan-Daan." No user shall charge fees for services rendered through this app.<br/>
• <b>Respectful Interaction:</b> Any form of harassment, hate speech, or inappropriate content in "Thank You" notes will lead to immediate account suspension.<br/>
• <b>Safety:</b> While we facilitate connections, we encourage all sessions to take place in public community centers like the Samudaya Bhavana.<br/><br/>

<b><font color="#006B5D">Disclaimer</font></b><br/>
Nimma-Guru is a directory service. We do not perform background checks on users. Users are encouraged to exercise caution and meet in public group settings.
]]></string>
